Package: git2pkg
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Isolated package builder from Git repositories
 git2pkg builds a Git repository inside a disposable Podman or Docker
 container and produces a native package or a standalone binary.
 The host system does not need a compiler toolchain or build libraries.
